^{:go/end 331} (go/func simdV11ImmIn1 "simdV11ImmIn1 generates a broadcast1ToN instruction,\ne.g. VDUP V1.S[0], V0.S4 (duplicate element 0 to all lanes)\nThe arrangement parameter specifies the element arrangement (e.g., ARNG_S, ARNG_D)\n" ^{:tag (* obj/Prog)} [^{:tag (* ssagen/State)} s ^{:tag (* ssa/Value)} v ^int16 arrangement]
